<title>POLAND: ZYWIEC JUNE NET RISES TO PLN 3.4 MLN.</title>
<headline>ZYWIEC JUNE NET RISES TO PLN 3.4 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results June</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p> JUNE		     1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	     3.35 vs   0.91</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 5.97 vs   1.01</p>
<p> Operating profit     6.60 vs   1.65</p>
<p> Sales		   41.76 vs  31.91</p>
<p> JANUARY-JUNE	   1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	    15.92 vs   3.12</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	26.93 vs   5.98</p>
<p> Operating profit    30.58 vs   8.46</p>
<p> Sales		  183.64 vs 117.48</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish brewery is Zaklady Piwowarskie w</p>
<p>Zywcu SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
